  "label": "User projected onto the insulted subject via the text",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the target of the insult, which is implied by the direct address in the text 'inbred you are' and 'cat piss you smell like'. The text explicitly uses 'you', directing the insult directly at the viewer/user, making the user the recipient of the abuse. The visual material of Yoda, who is the speaker of the insult, serves as the medium through which the projection is delivered, but the projection itself is onto the user as the 'you' in the text.",
